35,2,1,talk,Kenji,,Only two firms can do the digging. They flagged clay and slippage risk.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,People cross on firm ground. Drainage callouts have doubled since the culvert was capped.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,The staff roll is down to seven. But two volunteer groups help on weekends.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Minako,,"The old basin is fine, but the civic hall apron has been patched three times.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"The habitat fund only pays for planting and water, not surfacing or buildings.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, the drainage issue is serious. The ground is unstable.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, yes. The heat readings are also high. We need shade and drainage.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Minako, the volunteer groups are a good sign for ongoing care.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Minato, but the planting record is poor. Half the trees died.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Kenji, if the fund doesn't cover surfacing, we must avoid hard surfaces.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"The phasing notes say the south can be hoarded, but the centre cannot.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"The crossing data shows people avoid soft margins. They want open, firm paths.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,The bought-in services for water and turf are expensive. We need to be careful.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Minako,,The eastern avenue planting failed due to lack of aftercare. We must plan for maintenance.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,The upkeep ledger shows planted ground costs triple that of hard surfaces.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
